From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:16:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wallpaper: build without Glycin

Debian 13, Ubuntu 26.04 and EL10 have no Glycin package. Use Glycin
when it is installed. Otherwise decode the wallpaper preview with
gdk-pixbuf, which also tells whether the image is animated.

Without Glycin the preview is decoded in the portal process, not in the
Glycin sandbox, and only the formats of the installed gdk-pixbuf loaders
are shown.

This patch makes the dependency optional and sets HAVE_GLYCIN. The
decoder choice is in the overlay file
src/portal/backend/gnoblin-wallpaperpreview.c.

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 117823d..9d52b96 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -61,6 +61,9 @@ config_h.set_quoted('GETTEXT_PACKAGE', meson.project_name())
 config_h.set_quoted('LOCALEDIR', prefix / get_option('localedir'))
 config_h.set_quoted('PACKAGE_NAME', meson.project_name())
 config_h.set_quoted('PACKAGE_STRING', '@0@ @1@'.format(meson.project_name(), meson.project_version()))
+# Glycin decodes wallpaper previews in a sandbox. Without it, gdk-pixbuf decodes them in this process.
+glycin_dep = dependency('glycin-2', required: false)
+config_h.set('HAVE_GLYCIN', glycin_dep.found())
 built_sources += configure_file(output: 'config.h', configuration: config_h)
 
 # Sources
@@ -81,7 +84,7 @@ deps = [
   meson.get_compiler('c').find_library('m'),
   dependency('fontconfig'),
   dependency('glib-2.0', version: '>= 2.76'),
-  dependency('glycin-2'),
+  glycin_dep,
   dependency('gio-unix-2.0'),
   dependency('gdk-pixbuf-2.0'),
   dependency('libpipewire-0.3'),
